{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18948","headline":"敬宗睿武昭愍孝皇帝挽歌三首 一 · 刘禹锡","name":"敬宗睿武昭愍孝皇帝挽歌三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝历方无限，仙期忽有涯。\n事亲崇汉礼，传圣法殷家。\n晚出芙蓉阙，春归棠棣华。\n玉轮今日动，不是画云车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}